{
  "name": "@agentgate-builder/x402fix",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "mcpName": "co.youraitools/x402fix",
  "description": "x402 endpoint doctor for sellers and agent builders: point it at any paid x402 URL and get a graded list of what will break payments or Bazaar / x402scan listing (402 on GET/HEAD/POST, CORS, v2 header + v1 body, CAIP-2, USDC asset + EIP-712 domain, Solana feePayer, Bazaar schema, multichain price drift, payee checks, CDP validate verdict) with paste-ready fixes and a generated Bazaar block. Free MCP server; full reports via x402 pay-per-call API.",
